{"status":"ok","results":[{"source_url":"https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events_api.jsp","vault_path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/AudienceView Professional API Documentation Events API 2df0add15a3a.md","version":"","excerpt":"The links below provide information for one of our test accounts. They are clickable and give you the best example of the structure you will need to parse.  \nYou can replace 284 with \\[Your Client ID\\] when all the shows for the season are built.\nEvents API (Show Information)\n[https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284)](https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client\\(284\\);jsessionid=EE","digest":"2f7bfc4aa559db7e50ef7aea0a2f6010aca3aa787a12862832f5ecee549ddbed"},{"source_url":"https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events_api.jsp","vault_path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/AudienceView Professional API Documentation Events API 2df0add15a3a.md","version":"","excerpt":"The links below provide information for one of our test accounts. They are clickable and give you the best example of the structure you will need to parse.  \nYou can replace 284 with \\[Your Client ID\\] when all the shows for the season are built.\nEvents API (Show Information)\n[https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284)](https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client\\(284\\);jsessionid=EE","digest":"2f7bfc4aa559db7e50ef7aea0a2f6010aca3aa787a12862832f5ecee549ddbed"},{"source_url":"https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US","vault_path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/Help Articles & Documentation f4b13c9c4e66.md","version":"","excerpt":"-   ### Success Blueprints\n    \n    -   [Success Blueprint: Build Your Executive Director the Perfect Dashboard for the Upcoming Season](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Success-Blueprint-Build-Your-Executive-Director-the-Perfect-Dashboard-for-the-Upcoming-Season)\n    -   [Success Blueprint: Configure Quick Sale for Maximum Speed in the Box Office](https://help.audienceview.com/un","digest":"4ce09910aa39faf193f5f7f1f82d9699e6ecc38094a0cb9bd3061952a000f0d6"},{"source_url":"https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US","vault_path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/Help Articles & Documentation f4b13c9c4e66.md","version":"","excerpt":"## Configurations\n###### Access Control\nScan and validate tickets when ticket holders attempt to enter an event.\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000q7ztOAA/access-control)\n[**Application Security**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/security)\nAdd and maintain users, roles and groups and their permissions.\n[View All Articles]","digest":"4ce09910aa39faf193f5f7f1f82d9699e6ecc38094a0cb9bd3061952a000f0d6"},{"source_url":"https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US","vault_path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/Help Articles & Documentation f4b13c9c4e66.md","version":"","excerpt":"## Handbooks\nA foundational guide for you to use to create a manual for your day-to-day operations.\n[**Go to the handbook guide**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Customer-Services-Manual) →\n## Troubleshooting\nFind resources for troubleshooting error messages and issues.\n[**Access troubleshooting articles**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T00000","digest":"4ce09910aa39faf193f5f7f1f82d9699e6ecc38094a0cb9bd3061952a000f0d6"},{"source_url":"https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US","vault_path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/Help Articles & Documentation f4b13c9c4e66.md","version":"","excerpt":"## Utilities & Data Management\n[Utilities](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Utilities) enables you to perform a number of functions in a batch to update events, manage renewals, and print in large quantities.\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qAo5OAE/utilities-data-management)\n# Best Practices & Tips\n## Works","digest":"4ce09910aa39faf193f5f7f1f82d9699e6ecc38094a0cb9bd3061952a000f0d6"}],"omitted":[],"refreshed":0}
